# 🤖 Intelligent AI Chatbot using Large Language Models

## Overview

This project implements an AI-powered chatbot capable of holding natural conversations with users. It demonstrates how Large Language Models can be integrated into interactive applications.

The chatbot supports contextual conversations and can be extended with external tools and knowledge bases.

---

## Features

* Natural language conversation
* Context-aware responses
* Chat history
* Clean user interface
* Extensible architecture

---

## Tech Stack

* Python
* OpenAI API / Hugging Face
* Streamlit
* LangChain

